WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.921
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Roleplay!

2
00:00:05.221 --> 00:00:07.385
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.685 --> 00:00:09.511
Today's topic is Orchestra.

4
00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:15.259
Today we act out a conversation. I am the teacher and you are my friend.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.135
Harp!

6
00:00:18.035 --> 00:00:19.573
Harp. Your turn!

7
00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:23.253
Harp!

8
00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:24.322
Great!

9
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:26.504
Saxophone!

10
00:00:27.404 --> 00:00:29.673
Saxophone. Your turn!

11
00:00:32.573 --> 00:00:34.038
Saxophone!

12
00:00:34.338 --> 00:00:35.467
Wonderful!

13
00:00:36.483 --> 00:00:37.508
Accordion!

14
00:00:38.408 --> 00:00:40.456
Accordion. Your turn!

15
00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:44.450
Accordion!

16
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.728
Super!

17
00:00:46.717 --> 00:00:47.567
Cello!

18
00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:50.527
Cello. Your turn!

19
00:00:53.427 --> 00:00:54.300
Cello!

20
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.474
Excellent!

21
00:00:56.483 --> 00:00:58.042
Our sentence is:

22
00:00:58.342 --> 00:01:00.982
She plays the harp. He plays the tuba.

23
00:01:01.782 --> 00:01:03.190
Say it with me!

24
00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:09.865
She plays the harp. He plays the tuba.

25
00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:14.536
Hello, Malis! Which instrument would you like to play?

26
00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:16.359
She plays the harp.

27
00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:19.300
Nice! Do you like Harp?

28
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.974
Yes! I like Harp.

29
00:01:22.983 --> 00:01:26.727
Which instrument would you like to play? Your turn to answer!

30
00:01:31.027 --> 00:01:32.400
She plays the harp.

31
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.037
Great acting!

32
00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:39.841
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

33
00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:41.711
Bye-bye!

